\par\par \b \uc2 Indian rupee at 1-wk closing low on cbank presence  \b0\par\par\uc2 362 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Dezember 2006\par 04:04\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Updates to close)  \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Dec 8 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee eased to a one-week closing low on Friday as steady \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a stock market correction and nervousness ahead of the U.S. non-farm payrolls data weighed, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The partially convertible rupee <INR=IN> ended 0.17 percent weaker at 44.72/73 per dollar, and fell by a similar margin over the week. It was the weakest finish since Nov. 30, when the rupee ended at 44.74/75.  \par \par \uc2 "They (state-run banks) were there absorbing most of the dollar inflows at 44.69," said a chief trader at a large company. \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  usually \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  through state-run banks.  \par \par \uc2 "Also jitters ahead of the payrolls data saw people squaring off positions," the trader said.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar hugged tight ranges against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  ahead of the U.S. employment report, which could indicate whether U.S. interest rates are likely to come down. The jobs data is expected to show a rise of 110,000, but analysts see a downside risk on the number and thus for the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 Analysts say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in November was a factor in helping \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves jump more than $8 billion from late October to a record $175.49 billion on Dec. 1.  \par \par \uc2 Traders said a 1.2 percent fall in the stock market also weighed on sentiment. India's key share index snapped a five-session run of record closes due to weaker Asian markets and profit-taking in frontline index stocks.  \par \par \uc2 "But the stock market correction is seen temporary as the market expects foreign portfolio inflows into the Cairn IPO to be good and provide support to the rupee," said a chief dealer at a foreign bank.  \par \par \uc2 Cairn India, a subsidiary of Cairn Energy Plc aims to launch India's biggest IPO on Dec. 11, raising up to $1.4 billion.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  -----------------------------------------------------------\par                     MARKET SNAPSHOT\par  Bombay Sensitive Index          <.BSESN>\par  Indian rupee (vs $)             <INR=IN>\par  ------------------------------------------------------------\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDIA-RUPEE (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|RBN|SNI|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020061211e2c800052\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
