\par\par \b \uc2 Indian rupee at 3-week high as shares hit new peak  \b0\par\par\uc2 366 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Dezember 2006\par 04:05\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Updates to open)  \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Dec 5 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee rose on Tuesday to its highest level in more than three weeks, as local equities hit record highs, and traders said suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  checked the rupee's gains.  \par \par \uc2 The main stocks index <.BSESN> climbed more than 1 percent to above 14,000 points for the first time ever in early trade, boosted by rising foreign fund investment. The benchmark has gained more than 48 percent this year, making it the best performing major market in Asia-Pacific.  \par \par \uc2 At 10:25 a.m. (0455 GMT), the partially convertible rupee was about 0.15 percent higher at 44.54/55 per dollar, its highest since Nov. 11. It ended at 44.61/62 on Monday.  \par \par \uc2 Traders said state-owned banks were buying dollars, suspected to be on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not want a sharp appreciation in the rupee. We saw state-owned banks buying at the dips," said a senior dealer with a foreign bank.  \par \par \uc2 The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  through a clutch of state-owned banks to maintain \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's export competitiveness in global trade. It had forced the rupee down from an eight-month high of 44.35 in November.  \par \par \uc2 However, traders expect foreign funds to invest more money in local shares, which would further boost the rupee. Foreign funds have bought a net $8.8 billion of domestic shares in 2006 including $2 billion in November.  \par \par \uc2 These inflows have helped the rupee recover from a three-year low of 47.04, hit in July. "There were some foreign flows into the stock market today," said the chief dealer with a private bank.  \par \par \uc2 The rupee's rise was also aided by the dollar's movement against other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The U.S. unit stayed near 20-month lows versus the euro after soft U.S. data reinforced hopes the Federal Reserve may cut interest rates next year.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ------------------------------------------------------------\par                      MARKET SNAPSHOT\par  Bombay Sensitive Index          <.BSESN>\par  Indian rupee (vs $)             <INR=IN>\par  ------------------------------------------------------------\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDIA-RUPEE (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|Table|SNI|ABN|M|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020061208e2c50005x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
