\par\par \b \uc2 Indian rupee ends up on weak dlr, cbank caps gains  \b0\par\par\uc2 366 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Dezember 2006\par 04:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Updates to close)  \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Dec 4 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee edged up on Monday, helped by foreign fund inflows and the dollar's weakness against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but the gains were limited by suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said some state-run banks had consistently sold rupees for dollars, possibly on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The partially convertible rupee <INR=IN> closed at 44.61/62 per dollar, stronger than Friday's close of 44.655/665.  \par \par \uc2 "I would call this softer \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," a chief dealer with a foreign bank said. "I am more comfortable with this type of \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  because they at least allowed the rupee to move up, keeping in view the weak dollar," he said.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar recovered on Monday from a 20-month low against a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Expectations that the U.S. Federal Reserve might cut interest rates next year had pulled down the dollar.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the past month, possibly to keep exports competitive, contributed to a rise in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to a record $172.8 billion as at Nov. 24, analysts said. It has also hit the market's trading interest.  \par \par \uc2 The rupee hit a eight-month high of 44.35 per dollar on Nov. 10 but strong \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had forced it down.  \par \par \uc2 "Now that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is so aggressively defending, there is little trading interest," a chief dealer with a corporate said.  \par \par \uc2 Analysts say the rupee could come under pressure to rise as strong capital inflows are expected in coming weeks.  \par \par \uc2 The main stock index <.BSESN> ended at a record of 13,874.33 on Monday. Foreign investors have bought a net $8.8 billion of local stocks during 2006, helping the rupee recover from a three-year low of 47.04 hit in July.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ---------------------------------------------------------------\par  -                        MARKET SNAPSHOT    Bombay Sensitive\par Index          <.BSESN>\par  Indian rupee (vs $)             <INR=IN>\par  ---------------------------------------------------------------\par  -- ((Reporting by V.Ramakrishnan, editing by John Mair;\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Reuters Messaging: ramakrishnan.venkataraman.reuters.com@reuters.net; Tel: +91-22 6636-9039))  \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDIA-RUPEE (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|D|RBN|SNI|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020061207e2c40005y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
