\par\par \b \uc2 RPT-UPATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  cbank:  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 fx \highlight\uc2  market if necessary  \b0\par\par\uc2 285 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 November 2006\par 04:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2  (Repeats to local subscribers)  \par \par \uc2  MUMBAI, Nov 10 (Reuters) - India's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  always monitors rupee exchange rate volatility and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it deems fluctuations are excessive, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Yaga Venugopal Reddy said on Friday.  \par \par \uc2  State-run banks sold rupees for dollars in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday in what traders suspected was \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the rupee rose rapidly to its highest in nearly eight months.  \par \par \uc2  "We always keep monitoring volatility and try to identify whether there is excess volatility or not," he told reporters on the sidelines of a meeting.  \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  says its policy is one of careful monitoring and management of exchange rates with flexibility, without a fixed target, coupled with \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  if necessary.  \par \par \uc2  When asked by reporters if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday, Reddy said: "It has to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it was necessary, if not we won't."  \par \par \uc2  The partially convertible rupee <INR=IN> ended at 44.7100/7150 per dollar, having fallen from an intra-day high of 44.35 per dollar, which was its strongest since late March. It closed local trade on Thursday at 44.56/57 per dollar.  \par \par \uc2  The rupee has gained steadily from a three-year low of 47.04 hit on July 19, due to strong capital inflows.  \par \par \uc2  Indian shares <.BSESN> hit a record high on Friday and foreigners have been keen buyers as stocks have rallied more than 40 percent this year.  \par \par \uc2  According to a JP Morgan index <JPMREER>, the rupee is overvalued by nearly 9 percent compared to about 7 percent a month ago.      \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-INDIA-REDDY (UPDATE 1, REPEAT)|LANGEN|SNI|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020061113e2bd00072\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
