\par\par \b \uc2 State Bank India Chmn: INR/USD Movement Mkt Determined   \b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Mai 2006\par 10:41\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 NEW DELHI (Dow Jones)--The movement of the Indian rupee against the U.S. dollar is being determined by the market, not by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and its recent slide has been driven by the forces of demand and supply, the chairman of the State Bank of India (500112.BY) said Tuesday.   \par \par \uc2 "We are doing our normal commercial \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Dealers are taking positions," Arun Kumar Purwar told reporters when asked if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had asked SBI to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 The rupee has slipped nearly 1.5% against the dollar over the past week on portfolio outflows and steady demand for the dollar from oil importers looking to fulfill month-end payment commitments. [ 30-05-06 0901GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  sometimes \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market via state-run banks to protect the country's trade competitiveness and keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's volatility in check.   \par \par \uc2 Turning to the local stock markets, the chairman of the country's largest bank by assets said the Indian equity market was very attractive for buyers.   \par \par \uc2 "It's a good opportunity to buy. The fundamentals of the economy remain strong," he said.   \par \par \uc2 Local stocks have nose-dived in recent weeks, with the benchmark stock index tumbling more than 1,100 points since the beginning of this month, tracking the trend in global equity and commodity markets.   \par \par \uc2 The government expects the Indian economy to have grown a robust 8.1% during the last fiscal year that ended in March. It is expected to expand around 7.5%-8.0% during the current financial year.   \par \par \uc2 -By P.R. Venkat and V. Ramakrishnan, Dow Jones Newswires; +91-11-2307 4020; venkat.pr@dowjones.com   \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Mary de Wet and Graham Norris [ 30-05-06 0932GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020060530e25u000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
