\par\par \b \uc2 India Mohan: RBI Aims To Keep "Short-Term Rate Corridor"  \b0\par\par\uc2 457 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2006\par 08:07\par \uc2 Dow Jones Asian Equities Report\par \uc2 AER\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI (Dow Jones)--The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  plans to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  more in the secondary bond market in the coming fiscal year as part of its monetary management \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said Monday.  \par \par \uc2 "From April 1, we will not participate in the primary market (for government bonds) but it means that we will certainly need to step up our \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the secondary bond market," RBI Deputy Governor Rakesh Mohan told a finance conference.  \par \par \uc2 Under the Fiscal Responsibility and Budget Management Act, which comes into effect April 1, the RBI won't directly purchase bonds from the government. [ 27-03-06 0654GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Earlier this month, RBI officials said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the bond market in recent weeks to infuse funds into the cash-strapped local banking system. System liquidity has remained tight in recent months due to unusually strong growth in bank loans.  \par \par \uc2 Bank credit rose 32% in the past 12 months, the fastest in 35 years.  \par \par \uc2 Mohan said credit growth continuing at the current rate could raise liquidity management problems for the banking system, but added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has enough policy instruments to manage the situation.  \par \par \uc2 Apart from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the bond market, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has also been buying \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , redeeming securities previously sold under the so-called Market Stabilization Scheme and lending via repurchase auctions to help ease the liquidity situation.  \par \par \uc2 Mohan said the inflow of foreign capital would remain an important factor in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's liquidity management \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and added that "unsterilized" inflows could fuel inflation and cause \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market volatility.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has, in the past, sterilized excessive capital inflows by buying \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and then absorbing the cash pumped into the system in the process by selling bonds.  \par \par \uc2 Turning to interest rates, Mohan said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent monetary \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  haven't yet had a significant impact on long-term interest rates in the country. The RBI steps, however, have had some impact on short-term rates such as treasury bill yields, he added.  \par \par \uc2 The RBI aims to maintain the "corridor" or spread between its two short-term interest rates, the 5.5% reverse repurchase rate and the 6.5% repurchase rate, at the current 100 basis points.  \par \par \uc2 Separately, Mohan said international oil prices are widely expected to remain high. The RBI has raised policy-setting reverse repurchase rate by 100 basis points since October 2004 to fight the threat of inflation raised by high global oil prices.  \par \par \uc2 -By Judith D'Souza; Dow Jones Newswires; +91-22-2288 4212;  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par djn.in@dowjones.com   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Edited by Mary de Wet [ 27-03-06 0808GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument AER0000020060327e23r0000q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
